    "title": "",
    "legend": "A cystic lesion opening onto surface. Epidermis shows hyperplasia and papillomatosis. Tumour shows a papillary growth pattern, with papillae composed of fibrovascular cores with numerous plasma cells. The fibrovascular core is surrounded by two layers of cells: inner tall columnar cells with eosinophilic cytoplasm and decapitation secretion and an outer layer of small cuboidal cells.",
